Package: mathmodels
Type: Package
Title: Mathematical Modeling Algorithms
Version: 0.0.14
Authors@R: person("Jingxin", "Zhang", email = "zhjx_19@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Solves applied mathematical modeling problems in three
    families: multi-criteria evaluation, prediction, and dynamical systems.
    Evaluation covers indicator preprocessing, objective weighting by
    entropy, criticism, coefficient of variation, principal component
    analysis, or factor analysis, then aggregates scores using the technique
    for order preference by similarity to ideal solution, fuzzy
    comprehensive evaluation, grey relational analysis, rank sum ratio,
    data envelopment analysis, or inequality measures. Prediction covers grey
    system models, Markov chains, regression, interpolation, and time series
    forecasting, while differential equation solvers handle compartmental
    epidemic and population dynamics. Multivariate statistics, statistical
    inference testing, multiple imputation, data cleaning, and Word and
    LaTeX table export round out the package.
